WEBVTT

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:01.552
a whole lot easier,
and probably even better,

00:11:01.576 --> 00:11:03.532
but the whole health care sector

00:11:03.556 --> 00:11:06.616
will have benefited from your decision.

00:11:07.354 --> 00:11:08.536
Thank you.

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:12.246
(Applause)